    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d64-f1" n="27" xml:id="d64-f1-content">
                <p>A similar proclamation was issued on November 4, 1939, under authority of the
                    joint resolution of November 4, 1939; 54 Stat. 4 and 2672.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d64-f2" n="28" xml:id="d64-f2-content">
                <p>Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, October 7, 1939, pp.
                    326, 328.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
